Z||000000||deceler8||12-16-2001||11:53 AM||||Take one broken office chair base and one Fiero bucket seat (doesn't matter if it's driver or passenger) and what do you get...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dec15$04.jpg"> <P>I used a piece of 1/2 inch plywood to make the base that both the seat and base attach to. And this baby is comfortable too. If only I had a speaker seat to do this with.<P>I did take the track off and the plywood attaches with the original 13mm bolts.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dec15$03.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/deceler8_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
